WEBVTT

00:13.125 --> 00:15.375
Leave Chinatown to follow
me and you shall live.

00:15.541 --> 00:17.291
Otherwise, you shall die.

00:24.125 --> 00:26.875
In two months, Chinatown will belong to us.

00:31.541 --> 00:32.916
Why did you come here?

00:33.166 --> 00:34.291
To make money.

00:34.291 --> 00:35.416
His father has kidney disease.

00:35.416 --> 00:37.666
For me, I’m making money to marry Ut Det.

00:37.666 --> 00:40.125
His mom has a gambling addiction.

00:40.500 --> 00:41.750
 What are you going to
do when you come home?

00:41.750 --> 00:43.166
 But I can’t leave her alone there!

00:43.666 --> 00:44.916
We wanna join the Chinatown gang.

00:45.916 --> 00:48.166
All but two things can be traded here:

00:48.291 --> 00:49.916
humans and drugs.

01:00.875 --> 01:02.125
You're out of your mind!

01:02.666 --> 01:05.625
Your life is in this shit!

01:05.625 --> 01:06.666
Fuck you all!

01:07.000 --> 01:08.750
I gotta control my own fate.

01:09.125 --> 01:10.625
I gotta take care of my mom.

01:11.666 --> 01:12.666
You're out of your mind!

01:12.750 --> 01:13.791
Fuck you!

01:32.125 --> 01:34.750
Since the bloody battle at Chinatown,

01:34.875 --> 01:36.250
security has been tightened.

01:36.291 --> 01:38.791
The eradication of rogues
has been accelerated.

01:38.791 --> 01:41.375
The era of territorial rivalry is over.

01:43.208 --> 01:45.791
Chan, the one who murdered
Hung, has been arrested.

01:46.875 --> 01:49.083
Long, Phong, Ba

01:49.125 --> 01:52.041
withdrew from the criminal world
according to the wish of Hung Chinatown.

01:52.083 --> 01:55.125
The gangland at that
time was a calm lake.

01:55.791 --> 01:58.750
Until someone tries to stir it up.

02:08.416 --> 02:11.333
The blood debt must be paid with blood.

02:12.000 --> 02:15.833
A storm coming from The North Port
stirs Chinatown once more.

02:48.625 --> 02:50.250
I don't have to compensate.
My car is also damaged.

02:50.250 --> 02:52.250
So is mine. All the
goods are fallen out.

02:53.000 --> 02:54.375
Let me go check it out.

02:56.000 --> 02:58.541
- Just compensate.
- Call the police.

03:03.750 --> 03:07.250
Could you move aside?
You're in the middle of the road.

03:27.291 --> 03:28.750
[The North Port]

04:11.291 --> 04:12.625
Boss!

04:13.375 --> 04:14.750
Chan has been eliminated.

04:15.875 --> 04:16.916
What are you going to do?

04:18.333 --> 04:21.375
We're fucked up if we can't
sell cocaine in Chinatown.

04:24.416 --> 04:26.125
You must plan how to eliminate
Hai Cuong for me.

04:34.625 --> 04:36.625
Chan was used as bait,

04:36.625 --> 04:38.000
but…

04:40.625 --> 04:43.375
his death was unexpected.

04:44.541 --> 04:47.375
However, the target is now defined.

04:49.875 --> 04:51.500
I want you to travel to the North.

04:58.000 --> 04:59.500
Hung Chinatown is dead already.

05:00.875 --> 05:03.291
You must be careful from now on.

05:07.750 --> 05:09.000
Okay.

05:21.625 --> 05:24.416
[One-way road]

05:24.625 --> 05:27.125
Don't drive jerkily.
Just pedal evenly. Pedal evenly.

05:27.375 --> 05:28.041
Okay.

05:28.125 --> 05:28.541
Right

05:28.566 --> 05:29.566
Hey, Phong.

05:29.591 --> 05:30.841
Isn't Hien's car clinking?

05:30.916 --> 05:32.375
I wonder how much it costs.

05:33.000 --> 05:33.916
Dude!

05:33.916 --> 05:35.000
Hold the steering wheel!

05:36.000 --> 05:36.875
Turn the wiper off.

05:36.875 --> 05:38.291
Where? I didn't turn it on.

05:38.291 --> 05:39.375
Right here.

05:40.625 --> 05:41.750
Look ahead, please!

05:41.791 --> 05:43.250
- What? What are you saying?
- Look ahead.

05:43.750 --> 05:45.750
I think driving a car is pretty easy.

05:46.000 --> 05:47.500
Hey, watch out! Watch out!

06:03.000 --> 06:04.250
God damn!

06:04.375 --> 06:05.666
He's playing with us!

06:05.750 --> 06:06.791
I must teach him a lesson.

06:06.791 --> 06:08.000
Ba! Just let it slide.

06:08.250 --> 06:09.625
Don't you see he's getting high?

06:09.916 --> 06:12.041
I can't let it slide. I don't
have a driver's license.

06:12.125 --> 06:13.750
I'll be in jail if I run over him.

06:14.500 --> 06:15.750
Just let it slide.

06:15.875 --> 06:17.125
Three of us have promised with each other.

06:17.125 --> 06:18.791
Only solve the problems with your words,

06:18.875 --> 06:20.375
not your fists.

06:23.291 --> 06:25.250
He stuck his head in the wheel.

06:25.291 --> 06:26.250
Curse him!

06:26.375 --> 06:27.500
Ba! Calm down!

06:28.416 --> 06:29.666
How many months pregnant is your wife?

06:30.916 --> 06:32.166
Eight months.

06:32.250 --> 06:33.541
Let's say you got out and beat him.

06:33.541 --> 06:35.250
He would stab you with his knife.

06:35.416 --> 06:37.666
You would die.
Your baby would be fatherless.

06:38.125 --> 06:39.500
Your wife would be taken.

06:39.791 --> 06:41.166
Your child would be enslaved.

06:41.666 --> 06:43.250
I am your good brother.

06:43.375 --> 06:44.625
There's no way I'll let that happen.

06:44.916 --> 06:46.125
I would take your wife.

06:46.666 --> 06:47.875
Nonsense.

06:52.291 --> 06:53.250
Stab him.

06:53.291 --> 06:54.375
- Let it go.
- Do it.

06:55.250 --> 06:56.541
Just let it go.

06:56.791 --> 06:58.750
Put it away. Let it go.

06:58.916 --> 07:00.375
You're truly a good brother.

07:00.666 --> 07:02.000
You're enlightened.

07:02.875 --> 07:05.000
Well, let's drive to
another place to practice.

07:05.250 --> 07:06.375
Slip through.

07:08.291 --> 07:10.750
He stopped us earlier,
now he's breaking the car!

07:11.625 --> 07:12.750
It's Hien's car. Is that okay?

07:15.125 --> 07:17.000
Damn it! I'll beat him!

07:17.000 --> 07:17.875
Hey! Let it slide, Phong!

07:17.875 --> 07:18.750
Let it go, Phong!

07:18.791 --> 07:19.791
I'll beat him!

07:19.875 --> 07:22.041
No, let it go! Phong!

07:22.041 --> 07:22.541
I'll beat him!

07:22.625 --> 07:24.291
Let it go!

07:33.291 --> 07:34.291
Hien.

07:35.250 --> 07:36.416
Are you guys still good?

07:36.875 --> 07:38.000
Yes, we're still good.

07:38.250 --> 07:39.750
Come to Chinatown if you need anything.

07:39.750 --> 07:40.875
Okay.

07:42.750 --> 07:44.875
Come see us if you need anything.

07:47.125 --> 07:48.625
Oh, I mean

07:48.666 --> 07:51.375
Just call us if you need anything,

07:51.375 --> 07:52.500
we'll be there immedately.

07:54.625 --> 07:56.000
Goodbye, Sir.

08:55.875 --> 08:57.541
Chinatown was unable to smuggle items in.

08:58.500 --> 08:59.666
These are all we got.

09:03.125 --> 09:04.375
How about…

09:05.250 --> 09:06.666
You stop taking your parts?

09:14.250 --> 09:16.750
Do it yourself if you can.

09:18.916 --> 09:20.666
You think you're full-fledged now?

09:30.500 --> 09:32.000
I wash my hands with blood.

09:39.166 --> 09:40.500
I've got nothing to fear.

09:55.750 --> 09:57.125
This evening,

09:57.875 --> 09:59.000
let's break into Chinatown.

10:00.000 --> 10:02.375
Destroy any obstructions that arise.

10:04.250 --> 10:05.500
Kill them all.

10:21.375 --> 10:23.000
Do not ruin my business.

10:48.041 --> 10:49.625
Honey!

10:50.125 --> 10:51.625
My shift ends early today.

10:52.375 --> 10:54.375
I bought your favorite food.
What are you doing?

10:55.250 --> 10:57.125
I'm finishing up some
clothes for Ba's baby.

10:58.250 --> 11:00.166
When is Ut's due date?

11:00.375 --> 11:01.541
In more than a month.

11:03.125 --> 11:06.000
Take a look to see if it fits the baby.

11:09.166 --> 11:11.625
How can I know? The
baby hasn't been born yet.

11:12.041 --> 11:13.250
Just wait until the baby grows
older

11:13.250 --> 11:15.791
...and the clothes will fit anyways.

11:37.125 --> 11:38.375
Honey.

11:39.125 --> 11:41.250
Let's come back home with me in two weeks.

11:42.750 --> 11:46.166
I told my mom that she would
meet her daughter-in-law.

11:50.375 --> 11:52.125
Really?

11:53.375 --> 11:54.666
Now, let's eat.

11:54.750 --> 11:56.125
Don't let the food lose its taste.

12:02.375 --> 12:03.416
Dung.

12:04.375 --> 12:05.750
I have something for you.

12:08.916 --> 12:10.166
What is it?

12:11.250 --> 12:12.375
An amulet of peace.

12:13.125 --> 12:14.250
I got it from a temple.

12:17.250 --> 12:18.375
Let's eat.

12:26.375 --> 12:27.625
How about…

12:28.166 --> 12:31.000
We move to your hometown
to live with your mom?

12:39.125 --> 12:40.250
Do you really want to?

12:43.000 --> 12:44.500
My mom would be happy to hear that.

12:45.500 --> 12:46.916
Let's eat.

12:47.750 --> 12:49.500
Life in my hometown is pretty peaceful.

12:49.541 --> 12:50.791
But the work is strenuous.

12:51.041 --> 12:52.291
Could you bear that?

13:03.500 --> 13:06.250
You don't have to be that
hard even if you resent me.

13:06.625 --> 13:08.541
When will this kind of life end, dad?

13:26.125 --> 13:28.166
Do it yourself next time.
I'm tired of this.

13:41.375 --> 13:42.541
Let me do it for you.

13:55.375 --> 13:56.500
Big brother.

13:57.166 --> 13:59.500
The North Port has smuggled
drugs all over Chinatown.

14:00.500 --> 14:03.250
Our people only see
the short-term benefits.

14:04.791 --> 14:06.166
I can't control them anymore.

14:12.875 --> 14:15.500
- Those kind of people must be arrested.
- Yes.

14:20.625 --> 14:23.125
Aquaman!

14:23.500 --> 14:26.125
There are big waves up there.
Let's swim up there to surf.

14:49.875 --> 14:51.291
No. No way.

14:52.500 --> 14:53.625
Here.

14:54.000 --> 14:55.375
Please take him away.

14:55.625 --> 14:57.166
I can't run my business because of him.

14:57.250 --> 14:59.166
How can we take him
when he's holding his knives?

14:59.250 --> 15:00.250
He's right.

15:00.250 --> 15:02.250
Two knives in his hands.
Who dares to take him away?

15:02.875 --> 15:04.375
Soon means a couple of hours, dude.

15:06.750 --> 15:08.625
Just take a seat, you two.

15:08.875 --> 15:10.666
Let's just come in and
wait until afternoon.

15:10.875 --> 15:12.791
He'll wake up later, I had experiences.

15:14.875 --> 15:16.375
Curse him!

15:16.375 --> 15:18.041
Damn it!

15:19.750 --> 15:21.041
Here, have some water.

15:21.041 --> 15:22.291
Oh, thanks.

15:25.750 --> 15:26.916
Where's Long?

15:27.500 --> 15:29.250
I haven't been able to call him for days.

15:31.000 --> 15:32.250
He haven't told you yet?

15:32.625 --> 15:33.750
About what?

15:34.041 --> 15:35.875
He took Dung to his
hometown to see his mother.

15:35.875 --> 15:37.500
I thought you knew.

15:38.000 --> 15:39.250
I don't know anything.

15:40.125 --> 15:42.125
What kind of brotherhood is this?

15:43.250 --> 15:44.750
Don’t be mad.

15:44.750 --> 15:46.625
Even a hero can be defeated by a beauty.

15:46.625 --> 15:47.791
Your beauty came.

15:49.000 --> 15:50.125
Oh? Why are you coming over?

15:50.125 --> 15:51.500
You forgot your phone.

15:51.541 --> 15:53.416
I also bring you some food.

15:53.416 --> 15:55.125
My mom sent us caramelized pork and eggs.

16:02.125 --> 16:03.166
Oh God!

16:03.250 --> 16:04.500
He's defecating!

16:05.375 --> 16:06.750
What the hell? Don't look!

16:07.125 --> 16:08.541
Screw you!

16:08.625 --> 16:10.125
Just go away!

16:10.250 --> 16:11.416
Let's go! I'll take you home.

16:11.500 --> 16:13.125
We don't know what he's going to do next.

16:15.291 --> 16:16.500
Take him away, please!

16:21.875 --> 16:25.000
Jeez. God damn it!

16:25.750 --> 16:28.416
Just this time, okay? Don't walk
around during pregnant.

16:28.625 --> 16:30.041
It could affect the baby.

16:30.625 --> 16:31.875
Just stay home,

16:31.875 --> 16:33.166
and rest.

16:33.500 --> 16:35.416
- Be careful.
- It's so wet here.

16:36.250 --> 16:37.541
Stop walking around like today.

16:37.875 --> 16:40.125
Moving too much will affect the baby.

16:40.125 --> 16:41.291
I just want to bring you some food.

16:41.375 --> 16:43.250
I'll be happier if you just rest.

17:16.416 --> 17:17.875
Run!

17:18.416 --> 17:19.625
Run!

17:26.166 --> 17:27.500
Run!

18:27.125 --> 18:28.250
Ba…

18:36.041 --> 18:37.875
What are you guys doing here?

18:38.875 --> 18:40.291
Are you planning to kill people?

18:40.666 --> 18:42.000
Save our baby…

18:51.750 --> 18:52.791
Are you okay?

18:53.166 --> 18:54.416
Are you okay?

18:55.250 --> 18:58.000
Let me call someone to help you.

19:09.333 --> 19:10.458
How could he do it?

19:15.125 --> 19:16.875
Oh my God.

19:16.875 --> 19:19.000
How can you run a shabby place like this?

19:19.375 --> 19:20.541
Well, you see.

19:21.125 --> 19:23.000
You must pay me the rental fee.

19:23.000 --> 19:24.625
It's been two months.

19:24.750 --> 19:27.125
I have to redo my eyebrows.

19:27.125 --> 19:28.875
And also my pale lips.

19:28.875 --> 19:31.291
How subtle of you!

19:31.375 --> 19:33.166
How do you know I haven't eaten?

19:33.250 --> 19:34.500
Thank you.

19:34.500 --> 19:36.125
- Uh... Sis.
- What?

19:36.125 --> 19:38.416
Could you spare me three more days?

19:38.500 --> 19:39.625
What?

19:39.625 --> 19:40.875
Phong!

19:40.875 --> 19:42.875
Something happened to Ba and his wife!

19:45.291 --> 19:46.541
Hey!

19:46.625 --> 19:47.875
What about the stall?

20:07.666 --> 20:08.750
How is she?

20:09.250 --> 20:11.166
She has to stay here for a few days.

20:12.500 --> 20:13.750
Do you know who did that?

20:14.375 --> 20:15.500
No.

20:15.625 --> 20:16.875
Damn it!

20:19.375 --> 20:22.416
Take her back to your hometown after this.

20:23.875 --> 20:25.500
I think it's getting unstable here.

20:25.500 --> 20:26.541
Okay.

20:26.625 --> 20:28.250
Phong. Do you have money?

20:33.375 --> 20:34.625
It's for purchasing food.

20:35.000 --> 20:36.291
What about the stall?

20:37.000 --> 20:37.750
Screw it.

20:37.791 --> 20:38.916
What the hell?

20:39.000 --> 20:40.000
Think about it later.

20:40.041 --> 20:41.541
Go take care of Ut Det. Go.

20:41.666 --> 20:42.750
Jeez.

20:43.625 --> 20:46.291
Dude, bandage the wound.

20:46.500 --> 20:47.750
Gross.

20:47.750 --> 20:50.666
Just a minor injury. It hurts because
you touch it. No touch, no pain.

21:02.416 --> 21:03.625
Finished?

22:15.791 --> 22:17.916
All peace has its price.

22:20.250 --> 22:22.625
That's the police's business, not yours.

22:23.666 --> 22:24.875
Damn it!

22:24.875 --> 22:27.875
No matter what happens or not,
we keep moving from places to places.

22:27.916 --> 22:29.666
Living in the shadow like a rat.

22:30.125 --> 22:32.125
And losing the people we love one by one

22:32.166 --> 22:33.625
is the price of all this?

22:33.666 --> 22:35.625
Well…

22:35.916 --> 22:38.041
All for your safety.

23:02.375 --> 23:03.875
I don't want to talk to you anymore.

23:03.875 --> 23:05.291
I'm moving out tomorrow.

23:05.291 --> 23:06.541
Just do whatever you want.

23:20.750 --> 23:22.000
Hanh!

23:31.812 --> 23:33.108
Watch out!

23:45.288 --> 23:46.336
Damn it!

23:48.140 --> 23:49.146
Stop it!

25:32.750 --> 25:33.916
A Hien!

25:38.875 --> 25:41.041
Hold the door! Hold the door tight!

25:43.750 --> 25:45.666
Hanh! Go to your room! Quick!

25:46.125 --> 25:47.125
Dad!

26:47.750 --> 26:48.875
Dad!

26:49.500 --> 26:50.541
Dad!

26:53.537 --> 26:54.541
Dad!

26:56.725 --> 26:57.540
Dad!

27:29.750 --> 27:30.875
Hanh!

27:47.000 --> 27:48.333
Hanh!
